# The full Meshy downloads stay local: they are large (25-75 MB each). The committed copy of each
# model is source.glb (reduced to 150k triangles) and maps/ at 1024 px (CueModels.py compact).
*/model.glb
*/base_color.png
*/normal.png
*/roughness.png
*/metallic.png
*/emission.png

# Meshy rig and library clips (tools/meshy_rig.py): ~10 MB each, rebuilt from the task ids in
# rig/rig_meta.json and anims/anims_meta.json; the committed result is the ability export.
*/rig/*.glb
*/rig/*.fbx
*/anims/*.glb
